# Manifest Dread: "Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card" (CR 701.62a, 701.40b). Bot1 casts it with two
# Moxen, manifests Llanowar Elves from the top two cards and mills the Island; then turns the 2/2 face up as a special action
# for the Elves' {G} from its Forest. Face up it is a 1/1 Llanowar Elves, the same permanent, still untapped (CR 708.8).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Manifest Dread
Island x3
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

